# Project Context

## Project
Accounting Management System

## Stack
Frontend: React + TypeScript
Backend: Laravel
Database: MySQL
Auth: JWT

## Architecture

Frontend
   ↓ REST API
Laravel API
   ↓
Service Layer
   ↓
Repository
   ↓
MySQL

## Main Modules

- Authentication
- Cashflow
- Expense
- Revenue
- Inventory
- Reporting
- Dashboard

## Important Rules

Income:
amount > 0

Expense:
amount > 0
cannot exceed available balance

Transaction Status:
DRAFT
POSTED
CANCELLED

POSTED transactions cannot be deleted.

## Coding Rules

Controller
↓
Service
↓
Repository

Never place business logic inside Controller.

## Important Files

routes/api.php
app/Services/
app/Repositories/
resources/js/
database/migrations/
